{"sourceUrl":"https://gxy.cpu.edu.cn/b3/81/c12276a242561/page.htm","status":"full","attemptedAt":"2026-11-15T16:55:09.623536+00:00","httpStatus":200,"fetchedUrl":"https://gxy.cpu.edu.cn/b3/81/c12276a242561/page.htm","html":"<div><p><br/></p><p><span><span><span><span><span>为增进广大优秀本科生对中国药科大学工学院的了解，吸引更多优秀学生加入工学院，学院将组织开展</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span>2027</span></span><span><span><span><span>年接收推免生（含直博生）预报名工作（以下简称推免生预报名工作）。</span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><span><span>一、招生专业</span></span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><span>我院</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span>2027</span></span><span><span><span><span>年硕士招生专业目录中所有全日制专业均可接收硕士推免生。</span></span></span></span></span></p><table><tbody><tr><td><p><span><span><span><span><span>类别</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td><p><span><span><span><span><span>专业代码</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td><p><span><span><span><span><span>专业名称</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td><p><span><span><span><span><span>研究方向代码</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td><p><span><span><span><span><span>研究方向名称</span></span></span></span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td rowspan=\"2\"><p><span><span><span><span><span>学术学位</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td><p><span><span><span>1007Z1</span></span></span></p></td><td><p><span><span><span><span><span>制药工程学</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td colspan=\"2\" rowspan=\"2\"><p><span><span><span><span><span>不区分研究方向</span></span></span></span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td><p><span><span><span>077700</span></span></span></p></td><td><p><span><span><span><span><span>生物医学工程</span></span></span></span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td rowspan=\"5\"><p><span><span><span><span><span>专业学位</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td><p><span><span><span>086000</span></span></span></p></td><td><p><span><span><span><span><span>生物与医药</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td><p><span><span><span>02</span></span></span></p></td><td><p><span><span><span><span><span>制药工程与工艺</span></span></span></span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td><p><span><span><span>086000</span></span></span></p></td><td><p><span><span><span><span><span>生物与医药</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td><p><span><span><span>03</span></span></span></p></td><td><p><span><span><span><span><span>生物材料与诊断试剂</span></span></span></span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td><p><span><span><span>086000</span></span></span></p></td><td><p><span><span><span><span><span>生物与医药</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td><p><span><span><span>04</span></span></span></p></td><td><p><span><span><span><span><span>食品科学与营养工程</span></span></span></span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td><p><span><span><span>086000</span></span></span></p></td><td><p><span><span><span><span><span>生物与医药</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td><p><span><span><span>05</span></span></span></p></td><td><p><span><span><span><span><span>绿色制药与健康</span></span></span></span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td><p><span><span><span>095500</span></span></span></p></td><td><p><span><span><span><span><span>食品与营养</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td colspan=\"2\"><p><span><span><span><span><span>不区分研究方向</span></span></span></span></span></p></td></tr></tbody></table><p><span><span><span><span><span>直博生接收专业：</span></span></span></span></span></p><table><tbody><tr><td><p><span><span><span><span><span>类别</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td><p><span><span><span><span><span>专业代码</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td><p><span><span><span><span><span>专业名称</span></span></span></span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td rowspan=\"2\"><p><span><span><span><span><span>学术学位</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td><p><span><span><span>1007Z1</span></span></span></p></td><td><p><span><span><span><span><span>制药工程学</span></span></span></span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td><p><span><span><span>077700</span></span></span></p></td><td><p><span><span><span><span><span>生物医学工程</span></span></span></span></span></p></td></tr></tbody></table><p><span><span><span><span><span><span>二、报名条件</span></span></span></span></span></span></p><p><a href=\"https://gxy.cpu.edu.cn/b3/81/c12276a242561/page.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"></a><span><span><span><span><span><strong>（一）推免生预选拔报名考生应符合以下基本条件：</strong></span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span>1</span></span></span><span><span><span><span>.</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span>具有良好的思想品德和政治素质，遵纪守法，身心健康。</span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span>2</span></span></span><span><span><span><span>.</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span>全国高校</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span>2027</span></span><span><span><span><span>届应届本科毕业生，所学专业为药学类、中药学类、化学类、生物科学类、化工与制药类、生物医学工程类、生物工程类、基础医学类、食品科学与工程类、经济学类、统计学类、管理学类等相关专业，且预计可获得所在高校推荐免试资格。</span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span>3</span></span></span><span><span><span><span>.</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span>身体健康状况符合教育部等部门制定的《普通高等学校招生体检工作指导意见》。</span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span>4</span></span></span><span><span><span><span>.</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span>学习成绩优异，学术研究兴趣浓厚，有较强的创新意识、创新能力和专业能力，具有相应研究生培养潜质。在校期间曾参加科学研究、全国学术竞赛等活动表现突出者，及具有代表性科研成果者优先考虑。</span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><span>说明：未参加我校“</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span>3+1+X”</span></span><span><span><span><span>本研贯通人才培养直通车项目但符合上述条件的本校学生，可以报名参加常规学制年限的推免生考核。</span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><span><strong>（二）学术学位直博推免生报考基本条件：</strong></span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><span>申请学术学位直博生者，除满足上述报名条件（一）中的基本条件外，还应有较突出的专业素质，具有相应专业博士生培养潜质，学习成绩优异，并符合以下条件</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span>1</span></span><span><span><span><span>、条件</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span>2</span></span><span><span><span><span>中的一条且同时满足条件</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span>3</span></span><span><span><span><span>：</span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span>1</span></span></span><span><span><span><span>.</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span>国家级一流本科专业考生的本科推荐环节成绩排名前</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span>10%</span></span><span><span><span><span>（含</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span>10%</span></span><span><span><span><span>）；其他本科专业考生的本科推荐环节成绩排名前</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span>8%</span></span><span><span><span><span>（含</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span>8%</span></span><span><span><span><span>）；</span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span>2</span></span></span><span><span><span><span>.</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span>国家理科基础科学研究和教学人才培养基地班（理科基地班）、国家生命科学与技术人才培养基地班（生科基地班）、国家基础学科拔尖学生培养计划（拔尖计划）专业考生的本科推荐环节成绩排名前</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span>30%</span></span><span><span><span><span>（含</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span>30%</span></span><span><span><span><span>）；</span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span>3</span></span></span><span><span><span><span>.</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span>获得外语等级证书或成绩证明</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span>(</span></span><span><span><span><span>成绩有效期在</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span>4</span></span><span><span><span><span>年之内</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span>)</span></span><span><span><span><span>：</span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><span>六级（</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span>CET-6</span></span><span><span><span><span>）成绩≥</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span>450</span></span><span><span><span><span>分；</span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><span>或托福（</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span>TOEFL</span></span><span><span><span><span>）成绩≥</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span>90</span></span><span><span><span><span>分；</span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><span>或雅思（</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span>IELTS</span></span><span><span><span><span>）成绩≥</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span>7</span></span><span><span><span><span>；</span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><span>或以第一作者（排位第一）在</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span>SCI</span></span><span><span><span><span>期刊（不含扩展版）上发表过一篇专业学术研究论文。</span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><span>按照中国药科大学国家基础药学拔尖培养计划</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span>2.0</span></span><span><span><span><span>基地班的相关文件规定，该专业直博推免生推荐资格由孟目的学院及学校相关部门考核认定，暂不通过推免生预报名系统报考。</span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><span>特别说明：</span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span>1</span></span></span><span><span><span><span>.</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span>入选学校“</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span>3+1+X”</span></span><span><span><span><span>本研贯通人才培养直通车项目且考核合格的学生，需报名参加我院的推免生预选拔及复试考核，复试合格且在全国推免服务系统中实际拟录取的考生方可进入我院“</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span>3+1+X”</span></span><span><span><span><span>本研贯通培养体系。</span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span>2</span></span></span><span><span><span><span>.</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span>学院内限填报</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span>1</span></span><span><span><span><span>个硕士志愿；</span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span>3</span></span></span><span><span><span><span>.</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span>直博生申请人仅限填报</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span>1</span></span><span><span><span><span>个直博生志愿，并应同时填报硕士志愿。</span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><span><span>三、报名方式和时间</span></span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><span>系统报名阶段开放时间：</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span>7</span></span><span><span><span><span>月</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span>21</span></span><span><span><span><span>日</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>—</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span>8</span></span><span><span><span><span>月</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span>21</span></span><span><span><span><span>日</span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><span>报名方式：登录我校推免生预报名系统（</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span>http://yzs.cpu.edu.cn/logon</span></span><span><span><span><span>）</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span>,</span></span><span><span><span><span>如实填写各项信息并提交材料。报名项目选择“推免生预报名”。系统账户考生需自行注册使用，注册时须填写个人真实有效信息。</span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><span>学院对申请人资格进行审核，确定入选名单，并于</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span>8</span></span><span><span><span><span>月</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span>23</span></span><span><span><span><span>日前通知申请人，未收到通知者即未入选，不再另行通知。入选同学须于</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span>8</span></span><span><span><span><span>月</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span>24</span></span><span><span><span><span>日下午</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span>17:00</span></span><span><span><span><span>前在报名系统中回复确认是否参加，逾期未回复者视为自动放弃。</span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><span><span>四、报名材料</span></span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span>1</span></span></span><span><span><span><span>.</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span>身份证及在读学生证（必填）；</span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span>2</span></span></span><span><span><span><span>.</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span>由所在学校院系的教务部门开具的本科学习成绩单（必填）；</span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span>3</span></span></span><span><span><span><span>.</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span>就读国家级一流本科专业、理科基地班、生科基地班、拔尖计划的专业证明（符合条件者必填）；</span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span>4</span></span></span><span><span><span><span>.</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span>本科推荐环节成绩排名情况（必填）；</span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span>5</span></span></span><span><span><span><span>.</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span>外语水平证明，如</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span>CET-4</span></span><span><span><span><span>、</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span>CET-6</span></span><span><span><span><span>、雅思、托福、专业英语等（必填）；</span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span>6</span></span></span><span><span><span><span>.</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span>学术成果（包括公开发表论文、出版著作、获得专利、获得学术科技奖项、承担课题或者其他具有学术水平的工作成果）（选填）；</span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span>7</span></span></span><span><span><span><span>.</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span>获得各类荣誉、表彰、奖励证书（选填）；</span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span>8</span></span></span><span><span><span><span>.</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span>个人简历：限</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span>1</span></span><span><span><span><span>页，应包含科研经历及获奖情况（必填）；</span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span>9</span></span></span><span><span><span><span>.</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span>专家推荐书（暂不必填）：申请直博生者提供至少</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span>2</span></span><span><span><span><span>份《专家推荐书》（可在预报名系统中生成下载模板），由所报考学科专业领域内的正高级教授（或相当专业技术职称的专家）撰写的书面推荐意见（硕士推免生是否提交《专家推荐书》不做硬性要求）。</span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><span>报考硕士研究生的材料由学院进行资格审核。直博生的报考材料由研究生院统一进行资格审查。</span></span></span><span><span><span>申请人在网上填报及向学院提交的各类信息、材料，必须真实准确。若发现申请材料有虚假成分，一经查实将取消申请人一切由此获得的利益，并保留追溯的权利。</span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><span><span>五、考核安排</span></span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span>1</span></span></span><span><span><span><span>.</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span>本次活动采用线下形式进行。</span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span>2</span></span></span><span><span><span><span>.</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span>活动安排：（具体安排届时公布在学院网站）</span></span></span></span></span></p><center><table><tbody><tr><td><p><span><span><span><span><strong>日期</strong></span></span></span></span></p></td><td><p><span><span><span><span><strong>时间</strong></span></span></span></span></p></td><td><p><span><span><span><span><strong>活动内容</strong></span></span></span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td rowspan=\"2\"><p><span><span><span>8</span></span></span><span><span><span><span>月</span></span></span></span><span><span><span>28</span></span></span><span><span><span><span>日</span></span></span></span></p></td><td><p><span><span><span><span>上午</span></span></span></span></p></td><td><p><span><span><span><span>学科宣讲等</span></span></span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td><p><span><span><span><span>下午</span></span></span></span></p></td><td><p><span><span><span><span>各学科专家组面试考核</span></span></span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td><p><span><span><span>8</span></span></span><span><span><span><span>月</span></span></span></span><span><span><span>29</span></span></span><span><span><span><span>日</span></span></span></span></p></td><td><p><br/></p></td><td><p><span><span><span><span>参观实验室、自由交流等</span></span></span></span></p></td></tr></tbody></table></center><p><span><span><span><span><span><span>六、食宿交通及相关保障</span></span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><span>考生来校参加考核期间的交通、食宿费用自理。</span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><span><span>七、联系方式</span></span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><span>咨询邮箱：</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span>gxycpu@163.com</span></span><span><span><span><span>，尚老师</span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><strong>重点提醒：</strong></span><span>申请我校推荐免试研究生的</span></span></span></span><span><span><span>2027</span></span></span><span><span><span><span>年应届本科毕业生，在</span><span><strong>全国推免服务系统（预计</strong></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><strong>9</strong></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><strong>月中下旬）开放后，仍须在该系统中注册并填报志愿，并根据实际进程完成接收、确认复试、待录取通知等相应程序</strong></span><span>。届时请关注我校研究生招生网和中国研究生招生信息网的通知。</span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><span>欢迎各位同学报名！</span></span></span></span></span></p><p><br/></p><p><br/></p><p><span><span><span><span><span>工学院</span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span>2026</span></span><span><span><span><span>年</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span>7</span></span><span><span><span><span>月</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span>19</span></span><span><span><span><span>日</span></span></span></span></span></p><p><br/></p></div>","textSha256":"de254cd9cc7c4d3863092581992252ef08f8a179a2685c445cc47fe17cd363fa","textLength":2330,"sourceSha256":"6ceedf05b1c98c17bd01e047da2ac459ed6d0d2abd062f34a6ee1ec6143e0639","selector":".wp_articlecontent","attachments":[],"pdfs":[],"unavailableMedia":[],"id":"syp-4e42e6e208ca90b781c4","title":"2026年中国药科大学工学院2027年接收推免生（含直博生）预报名通知","capturedAt":"2026-11-15T16:55:09.623536+00:00"}
